# oracle: PPPM kspace_modify diff ad, orthogonal box 10x11x13, automatic G and grid at 1e-5 (rel 1e-7: the G-ewald stop is ill-conditioned, a 2e-15 change in q2 moves G by 2e-8; measured G 8e-8 rel, ecoul 4.5e-8 rel, all else under 1e-8)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 3.6e-12, atoms 2.1e-14.
units           real
atom_style      charge
lattice         sc 3.2
region          box block 0 10 0 11 0 13 units box
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
group           odd id 1:1000:2
set             group odd type 2
mass            1 15.0
mass            2 20.0
set             type 1 charge 0.42
set             type 2 charge -0.38
variable        dx atom 0.15*sin(0.43*x+0.27*y)
variable        dy atom 0.15*cos(0.31*y-0.23*z)
variable        dz atom 0.15*sin(0.37*z+0.19*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 8.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.0 1.0
pair_modify     table 0
kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-5
kspace_modify   diff ad
thermo_style    custom step pe evdwl ecoul elong press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
